; The standalone Sift ppx — the whole DX ([@@deriving model], [@@deriving collection], and the
; [%q]/[%fields]/[%sort]/[%set]/[%index] query DSL) in ONE ppx pass, for libraries that DON'T use the
; fur/MLX ppx. Libraries on (pps fennec.fur.ppx) get it for free (fur.ppx links the same rules).
(library
 (name sift_ppx)
 (public_name fennec.pulse.sift.ppx)
 (kind ppx_rewriter)
 (libraries fennec.pulse.sift.ppx.rules ppxlib))
